text:
Average GDP per capita by continent

gdp_by_year &lt;- gapminder |&gt;
  filter(year %in% c(1952, 2007)) |&gt;
  group_by(continent, year) |&gt;
  summarise(mean_gdp = round(mean(gdpPercap), 0), .groups = "drop")

gdp_by_year |&gt;
  pivot_wider(names_from = year, values_from = mean_gdp) |&gt;
  mutate(times = round(`2007` / `1952`, 1)) |&gt;
  arrange(desc(`2007`))

# A tibble: 5 × 4
  continent `1952` `2007` times
  &lt;fct&gt;      &lt;dbl&gt;  &lt;dbl&gt; &lt;dbl&gt;
1 Oceania    10298  29810   2.9
2 Europe      5661  25054   4.4
3 Asia        5195  12473   2.4
4 Americas    4079  11003   2.7
5 Africa      1253   3089   2.5

The richest countries in 1952

gapminder |&gt;
  filter(year == 1952) |&gt;
  arrange(desc(gdpPercap)) |&gt;
  select(country, continent, gdpPercap) |&gt;
  head(5)

